.claude/**/*.local.*
.claude/worktrees/

# Per-plugin test sandbox work roots (repo-relative, never committed). Glob covers
# every plugin's tests/.sandbox/ so the four-split plugins are ignored without per-name edits.
plugins/*/tests/.sandbox/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.vs/
.vscode/settings.json
.vscode/launch.json
*.user

# .NET build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

# Logs
*.log

# Private keys / credentials — nothing in this repo ever needs one committed.
#
# 這裡沒有既有的違規要清,是純預防:2026-08-07 為 release-please 建 GitHub App 時會下載一份
# private key,而下載後最自然的動作就是把它丟在手邊某個資料夾。憑證外洩不像壞掉的測試會自己
# 表現出來——它安靜地留在歷史裡,而 git 歷史清不乾淨(要 rewrite + 強推 + 所有 clone 重來)。
# 這類規則的價值全在「加在事情發生之前」。
#
# 正式的存放位置是 repo secret(GitHub Actions 從那裡讀),本機那份用完就該刪。
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx